{
  "_comment": [
    "对话流里的卡片：A2UI 组件树。宿主把它包成 createSurface + updateComponents 喂给引擎。",
    "顶层只放 components 数组，不要写 version / surfaceId / messages —— 那些由宿主合成。",
    "绑定路径以 tool 出参为根：handler 打出 {\"{{ENTITY_PLURAL}}\": [...], \"count\": N}，",
    "所以这里写 /count、/{{ENTITY_PLURAL}}；List 项内部用相对路径（title 而非 /title）。",
    "改组件前先读 references/a2ui_card.md，组件名和属性必须来自 catalog。"
  ],
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "root",
      "component": "Card",
      "child": "body",
      "style": {
        "padding": 14,
        "containerColor": "basic_container_primary",
        "borderWidth": 0.5,
        "borderColor": "card_border",
        "shape": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "body",
      "component": "Column",
      "children": ["heading", "summary", "list", "expand"]
    },
    {
      "id": "heading",
      "component": "Text",
      "text": "{{APP_NAME}}",
      "variant": "h4"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary",
      "component": "Text",
      "text": { "path": "/count" },
      "variant": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "list",
      "component": "List",
      "children": { "path": "/{{ENTITY_PLURAL}}", "componentId": "row" }
    },
    {
      "id": "row",
      "component": "Column",
      "children": ["row-title", "row-notes"]
    },
    {
      "id": "row-title",
      "component": "Text",
      "text": { "path": "title" },
      "variant": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "row-notes",
      "component": "Text",
      "text": { "path": "notes" },
      "variant": "caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "expand",
      "component": "Button",
      "child": "expand-label",
      "variant": "primary",
      "action": {
        "event": {
          "name": "open_workspace",
          "context": { "resourceUri": "{{WORKSPACE_URI}}" }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "expand-label",
      "component": "Text",
      "text": "查看全部"
    }
  ]
}
